    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are excited to present this top floor two bedroom apartment to the market located in the quiet development of Esker Manor. The M50 and M4 are located close by and make commuting around Dublin and beyond hassle free. Within minutes' walk you will find a host of shops, bars and restaurants. Local schools are within walking distance and bus routes are located at the front of the development.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 80 sq m comprises of open plan living room/ kitchen/dining room with two double bedrooms boasting fitted wardrobes, master ensuite and a main family bathroom. The property also benefits with attic space for storage and a glass panelled door from the spacious living area leads onto a balcony with views of the communal gardens.\n\nNo. 89 is presented in good condition throughout and boasts a long list of additional features to include a B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, attic space, a spacious layout, heaps of built in storage and top quality flooring throughout. Ideal for first time buyers and investors. Early viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 102 5390 or 01 554 1699 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nFeatures;\n c. 80 sq.m\n BER B qualifying of a green mortgage\n 2 Bed 2 Bath\n Top floor apartment\n Balcony facing on communal gardens\n Peaceful development\n Built in wardrobes\n Gas fired central heating\n Attic space\n Management fee c, 1300\n Within seconds of Griffeen Valley Park\n In close proximity to Lucan Village\n Within easy reach M50 Motorway\n Primary and secondary schools in close proximity\n Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers and investors\n Viewing highly advised!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 9"
      }
